00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,823
Today's lesson will help you learn how to observe and describe external appearance characteristics of the person to describe.

2
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:22,230
Coastal boy.

3
00:00:24,568 --> 00:00:47,850
Thang is the best swimmer of Bans village children,

4
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:56,707
sitting on a boat moored at the far end.

5
00:00:59,129 --> 00:01:16,768
He is taller than Chan "Skinny" by a head but very thin.

6
00:01:17,436 --> 00:01:35,019
He is shirtless, showing healthy sun-reddened skin of children growing up with sun, salt water and sea wind.

7
00:01:36,152 --> 00:01:42,436
The body is firm and strong:

8
00:01:44,102 --> 00:02:09,651
Thick neck, wide shoulders, chest puffed tight, flat abdomen showing clear muscles, two arms like two rowing oars, big thighs, strong.

9
00:02:10,860 --> 00:02:17,231
Thang has big bright eyes.

10
00:02:19,235 --> 00:02:23,915
Fresh mouth, likes to smile.

11
00:02:24,930 --> 00:02:32,372
The forehead slightly protrudes, looks like a stubborn, gallant boy.

12
00:02:37,370 --> 00:02:41,374
You read the passage and tell.

13
